# Input

```astro
---
const b = 1;
---
<div class=`a ${b} c`>x</div>
<div class=`plain`>y</div>
<div class="normal">z</div>

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
const b = 1;
---

<div class=`a ${b} c`>x</div>
<div class=`plain`>y</div>
<div class="normal">z</div>

```
